{{- else}}
    - No staffing batch is applied; nothing to reverse.
{{- end}}
{{- range .Proxies}}
  Historical remote fee proxy for {{.Ref}}: {{proxyMoney .Cents}} from {{.Studies}} relevant studies; requested trailing lookback {{.LookbackDays}} days. Available run observation period: {{.AvailableFrom}} to {{.AvailableTo}}. Incomplete lookback: {{.Incomplete}}.
    Windows: {{windows .Windows}}; scope: {{.Scope}}. The engine prices studies that waited unread during matching windows and scope at the first qualifying instant, including its night surcharge. Two lanes are shared by all contracts; employed readers claim first. This is not a guaranteed future fee and not a utilisation bound. History before the available run period is unavailable.
